Seven weekday slots (Mon → Sun), each an equal share of the rail. Code reads Day*/Chip/Box/NumRow/{DayTag,Num} + Day*/Chip/Box/Abbr in child order: Num = day inside the phase (CalendarSystem.day_in_phase of that weekday), Abbr = MON … SUN, DayTag (\"DAY\") only on today; the current day's chip is filled amber by code."
