Code fills this with item scenes (WeekMapSection · WeekMatchCard · WeekNoteCard · WeekIncidentCard · WeekAfternoonCard · WeekAfternoonDoneCard); separation = the gap between cards. Its width is pinned to the scroll's width (cards run under the scroll bar, as before)."
