unique_name_in_owner = true
editor_description = "[필수] 지우면 오류: WeekProgressView.gd _fit_safe_area()
Bottom action bar: %Stage (1) : %Action (2), primary at the right. Code adds the bottom inset (OutgameTheme.fit_bottom_bar). On a match day %Stage is hidden and %Action takes the full width."
